    apply: "This week, choose one ordinary task, such as a chore or work assignment, and consciously offer it to God as worship. Prepare for the next church service by praying for it and arrive ready to participate. Find one person to encourage there.",
    activity: "Ask learners to list ways that people worship in their daily lives and write them on the board. Then read Romans 12:1-2 and Colossians 3:16-17 and discuss how these verses widen our view. Close with a few minutes of free worship in song or prayer.",
