    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners what it means to worship in spirit and truth.",
    mcq1: ["According to John 4:24, how must God be worshipped?", ["In spirit and truth", "Only on a mountain", "Only in silence", "Only with money"], 0, "God is spirit and must be worshipped in spirit and truth."],
